OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with clear periods. Then
OL,7,Fthe rest of the night will remain dry
OL,8,Fbut some high cloud spreading from the
OL,9,Fwest. Chilly.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FMostly dry with some bright
OL,12,For sunny spells, just the odd light
OL,13,Fshower across the west later. Somewhat
OL,14,Fcolder than of late.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FAfter
OL,17,Fa dry morning a few showers will
OL,18,Fdevelop in the afternoon. Early
OL,19,Fshowers on Thursday otherwise dry and
OL,20,Fbright, rain by evening. Early rain on
OL,21,FFriday then dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
